# The three bags this manifest composes. Declared in bag.yaml with a pinned
# commit each, and fetched by `barry install` -- so a checkout here is build
# output, not content this repo should carry. They were submodules until
# 2026-09; committing the directories now would re-create the duplication
# that removing the submodules got rid of.
/point-guard/
/point-guard-macos/
/point-guard-ios/
